      "symbol": "getDataDiskInfo",
      "type": "function",
      "description": "Gets the total, available, and used capacity of the data partition (`data://`) in bytes. This covers the whole data partition, not the current application's storage usage. Check `isSuccess` before reading the capacity fields.",
